1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,417
The garden gate stays open
until the evening.

2
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,708
<i>Water the tomatoes first.</i>

3
00:00:14,792 --> 00:00:17,167
Then the beans by the wall.

4
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,000
The hose is in the shed.

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,417
Has anyone seen the blue bucket?

6
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:05,000
It was by the pond this morning.

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,917
I will look there after lunch.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:10,708
Thanks.

9
00:01:19,583 --> 00:01:20,292
Wait.

10
00:01:20,042 --> 00:01:22,000
- Over here!
- Coming.

11
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:31,167
Rain at four.
